LARGE SPOILERS:


You can always get up to +7 in normal mode.  Higher than that risks
evaporation of the weapon.  Nethack wraps around if your hitroll is too good,
so if you're a level 30 with a +127 weapon, your chance to hit will be lousy,
instead of great.  The reason why you wish for +3 things, or 3 objects,
has to do with how nethack evaluates wishes.  To see if you get the plus, or
# of items, that you want, it picks a number between 1 and 5.  If this number
is greater than or equal to yours, you get the + or number you wanted.
Otherwise you get either 1 item, or +0 enchantment.  So, the chance
to get a +1 item is 100%, for a +2 80%, for a +3 60%, for a +4 40%, and
for a +5 20%.  So you have a better than even chance of getting a +3 item.
Any higher plus and you probably won't get it.

